<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>LibTrack - Library Visit Monitoring System</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/landing-page.css">
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="logo">
            <h2>LibTrack</h2>
            <span>Library Visit Monitoring</span>
        </div>

        <nav>
            <a href="/">Home</a>
            <a href="#features">Features</a>
            <a href="#about">About</a>
            <a href="/login" class="login-btn">Admin Login</a>
        </nav>
    </header>
    <main>
        <section id="home">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <span class="tagline">LIBRARY ADMINISTRATION SYSTEM</span>

                <h1>
                    Track Library Visits.<br>
                    <span>Understand Student Activity.</span>
                </h1>

                <p>
                    LibTrack helps library administrators monitor
                    student visits and analyze library attendance
                    according to academic course.
                </p>

                <a href="/login" class="primary-btn">
                    Get Started
                </a>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section id="features">
            <div class="section-heading">
                <h2>System Features</h2>
                <p>
                    Simple tools to monitor and understand library visits.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="features-container">

                <div class="feature">
                    <h3>Student Visit Monitoring</h3>
                    <p>
                        Record and monitor the number of students
                        visiting the library.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="feature">
                    <h3>Course-Based Statistics</h3>
                    <p>
                        View how many students from each academic
                        course visit the library.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="feature">
                    <h3>Attendance Reports</h3>
                    <p>
                        Review library visit records by date,
                        course, and total attendance.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="feature">
                    <h3>Admin Dashboard</h3>
                    <p>
                        Access organized attendance summaries and
                        statistics in one convenient dashboard.
                    </p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="about">
            <h2>About LibTrack</h2>

            <p>
                LibTrack is a library visit monitoring system
                developed for library administrators. It helps
                track student attendance, determine which academic
                courses frequently use the library, and generate
                useful attendance statistics for administrative
                monitoring and planning.
            </p>

            <p>
                The system focuses on student visits and course-based
                attendance rather than book borrowing or returning.
            </p>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>
            2026 LibTrack. All rights reserved.
        </p>
        <p>Library Visit Monitoring System</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>